{"spanish-0":{"kind":"spanish","lines":[["You","Soy estudiante.","I’m a student."],["You","Estoy en la biblioteca.","I’m in the library."],["You","Tengo una pregunta.","I have a question."]]},"spanish-5":{"kind":"spanish","lines":[["Café worker","¿Para aquí o para llevar?","For here or to go?"],["You","¿Puede repetirlo más despacio, por favor?","Can you repeat it more slowly, please?"],["Café worker","¿Para aquí o para llevar?","For here or to go?"],["You","Para llevar, por favor.","To go, please."],["Café worker","¿Para llevar?","To go?"],["You","Sí, para llevar.","Yes, to go."]]},"spanish-6":{"kind":"spanish","lines":[["You","¿Dónde está la farmacia?","Where is the pharmacy?"],["Local person","Siga recto y gire a la derecha.","Keep going straight and turn right."],["You","¿A la derecha?","To the right?"],["Local person","Sí. Está al lado del banco.","Yes. It’s next to the bank."],["You","Gracias.","Thank you."]]},"spanish-7":{"kind":"spanish","lines":[["Friend","¿Quieres tomar un café el sábado?","Do you want to have a coffee on Saturday?"],["You","Me gustaría, pero no puedo el sábado.","I’d like to, but I can’t on Saturday."],["Friend","¿Y el domingo?","And Sunday?"],["You","El domingo sí. ¿A las once?","Sunday works. At eleven?"],["Friend","Perfecto.","Perfect."]]},"piano-0":{"kind":"piano","title":"Hear the same four beats two ways","intro":"Stay on C. Compare the number of new attacks while the four-beat count stays the same.","keys":["C4","C#4","D4","D#4","E4","F4","F#4","G4","G#4","A4","A#4","B4","C5"],"count":"Count 1, 2, 3, 4. Hold through a beat rather than pressing again.","patterns":[{"label":"Four one-beat notes","beats":4,"events":[{"note":"C4","at":0,"beats":1},{"note":"C4","at":1,"beats":1},{"note":"C4","at":2,"beats":1},{"note":"C4","at":3,"beats":1}],"description":"four attacks over four beats."},{"label":"Two two-beat notes","beats":4,"events":[{"note":"C4","at":0,"beats":2},{"note":"C4","at":2,"beats":2}],"description":"two attacks over four bea